    add('The portable ensemble export matches the fitted calibrated components within 1e-5. Local SHAP KernelExplainer is evaluated with 256 coalition samples, seed 31, and an aggregate fit-median/modal reference; the offline ensemble report uses eight test examples, not a population-level explanation study. The application separately explains its served calibrated forest using the same bounded method and checks prediction parity and additive reconstruction before returning attributions. Contributions are reference-dependent associations, not causal effects, and the initial lightweight median-replacement effects are explicitly labeled as a different method.')
    add('### 11.3 Connected application and current refinement boundary')
