    add('The release client excludes private environment files and authenticates model requests with the current user session. Contract, persistence, routing, prediction parity, missingness, out-of-support and identifier-rejection tests cover this connection. Actual hosted authentication/database access and deployment remain separate operational checks. Production retrieval also now implements bounded synonym expansion, finer recommendation concepts and optional MMR diversity after cross-encoder reranking; the numerical retrieval results in Section 7 remain those of the frozen earlier experiment and are not attributed to these unbenchmarked refinements. An explicit Ollama-compatible local transport is implemented without automatic cloud fallback. A local Qwen3:4b-q4_K_M call passed a constrained-JSON transport check; this establishes local connectivity and response formatting, not care-plan quality or clinical validity.')
